{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"title":"GMNCustomTag","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNCustomTag","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNCustomTag","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNCustomTagV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Tags","generated":true,"anchor":"Tags","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNCustomTag","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the payload of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", one of the two untyped lanes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the tag model, and it is exactly the shape every tag had before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"model was typed: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound to nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is how GMN accommodates third-party extension: a name outside its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved vocabulary is not an error, but a custom tag that round-trips"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact and realizes as a no-op, ready for a consumer or a downstream tool"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to give it meaning."}]},{"text":"What lands here","anchor":"What-lands-here","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name outside GMN’s reserved vocabulary: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bembel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\splitChord"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\shortFermata"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\chord"},{"type":"text","text":", and anything a consumer invents. Nothing reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what was written to such a tag, so there is no schema to bind against and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing to model. It round-trips byte for byte and realizes as a no-op."}]},{"text":"What does not land here","anchor":"What-does-not-land-here","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A reserved name that failed to promote is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this. The distinction is enforced by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which fails for a reserved name — so a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GMNCustomTag"},{"type":"text","text":" never carries a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved name, at any stage, and the case cannot be used as a general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"escape hatch."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmncustomtag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN does not reserve, carried in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its untyped, as-written form.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/body","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/ident-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/name-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/parameters"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Ident-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Name-swift.typealias","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Parameter"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorGMN/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorGMN/